   "reading": "three independent runs on three seeds agree to 0.10 mm at the positive end. A residual that repeats per place is a property of that place, not vehicle noise, which points at the surface the ray is solved against rather than at the vehicle or the camera.",
   "caveat": "the negative end pools eight intervals from several distinct events including a pause-resume, so its spread may be sub-locations rather than true scatter"
  },
  "next": "compare the heightfield the solve uses, the 20 cm source field, against the surface actually imaged at those locations. The vehicle rides a 1025-square resample of that field and the camera images the triangulated visual mesh; neither is guaranteed identical to the source at a given point.",
